        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: EuropaCorp\n- People: Luc Besson\n- Works: Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds, Arthur and the Invisibles, Arthur and the Revenge of Maltazard\n- Series: Arthur series\n\nFacts:\n- EuropaCorp produced Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds.\n- Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds is the third and final installment in Luc Besson's Arthur series.\n- Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds follows Arthur and the Invisibles and continues Arthur and the Revenge of Maltazard.\n- Arthur and the Revenge of Maltazard performed disappointingly in the rest of the world.",
